sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Activity / Filament
    participant V as PublicationVersionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GC as PublicationMediaCleanupService
    participant A as AdminAuditService
    participant N as AdminNotifier
    UI->>UI: Reset-Bestaetigungsdialog
    UI->>V: resetStagedChanges(actor)
    V->>DB: BEGIN + Advisory Lock + Schema-Paritaet
    V->>DB: pendingCount(Working vs LIVE)
    alt Kein fachlicher Diff
        V->>DB: workingContext loeschen
        DB-->>V: COMMIT; 0
        UI->>N: Nothing staged (info)
    else Diff vorhanden
        V->>GC: queueAbandonedWorkingMedia
        V->>DB: Working durch committed.* ersetzen
        V->>DB: workingContext loeschen
        V->>A: publication.stage_reset
        DB-->>V: COMMIT
        V->>GC: drain nach Commit
        UI->>N: Staged changes reset (success)
    end
    Note over UI,DB: LIVE und vorhandene Audit-/Checkpoint-Historie bleiben bestehen
